crc32-v2 (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * CRC-32 byte-at-a-time, slicing-by-4/8/16 algorithms.
  * Zero-alloc hot path, fat LTO, codegen-units=1.
  * Python (crc32-rs) and Node.js (crc32-rs) native bindings.
  * crc32-codegen build-time table generation subcrate.

